:     \"tablets\": \"قرص اقراص أقراص tablet tablets tab tabs\",\n44:     \"capsules\": \"كبسول كبسولة كبسوله كبسولات capsule capsules cap caps\",\n45:     \"syrup\": \"شراب syrup\", \"drops\": \"قطرة قطره نقط drops\",\n46:     \"spray\": \"بخاخ بخاخة بخاخه spray\", \"gel\": \"جل gel\",\n47:     \"ampoules\": \"امبول أمبول امبوله امبولة أمبولة امبولات ampoule ampoules\",\n48:     \"vial\": \"فيال vial vials\", \"suppository\": \"لبوس اقماع أقماع suppository suppositories\",\n49: }\n50: \nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
{"step_index":6727,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-24T14:35:34Z","thinking":"Identifying distinct strength types is crucial for accurate matching; segregating these from pack size considerations streamlines the comparison logic. When a match is initially proposed, conflicting strengths (as indicated by the Arabic phrase, \"اختلاف صريح في التركيز (خط أحمر\") necessitate a \"no_match\" status to prevent incorrect item selection.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Update match_guards.py to enforce the new Decision Graph rules\"","EndLine":"118","Instruction":"\"Update guard_decision and measurement extraction to adhere to new approved rules\"","ReplacementContent":"\"STRENGTH_KINDS = {\\\"mass_mg\\\", \\\"volume_ml\\\", \\\"percent\\\"}\\n\\ndef strength_measurements(text):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Extracts only critical strengths/concentrations (mass, volume, percent).\\n    Pack sizes (tablets, strips, counts) are excluded as they do not prevent matching.\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    found = Counter()\\n    for match in MEASURE.finditer(product_text(text)):\\n        kind, factor = UNITS[match[\\\"unit\\\"]]\\n        if kind in STRENGTH_KINDS:\\n            found[(kind, Decimal(match[\\\"number\\\"]) * factor)] += 1\\n    return found\\n\\n\\ndef guard_decision(case, decision, catalog):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    Applies the new approved pharmaceutical Decision Graph:\\n    1. Strength / Concentration is a RED LINE: Explicit conflict -> NO_MATCH.\\n    2. Dosage Form: Different form with matching product and strength -> REVIEW.\\n    3. Packaging / Pack Count / Bare Numbers / Price markers -> DO NOT prevent MATCH.\\n    4. Reversal / OCR hints -> REVIEW.\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    result = {\\n        **decision,\\n        \\\"model_status\\\": decision[\\\"status\\\"],\\n        \\\"model_item_ids\\\": list(decision.get(\\\"item_ids\\\", [])),\\n        \\\"model_rea